    "Only allowed gates (AND, OR, XOR, NOT) are used throughout the schematic.",
    "The carry chain propagates correctly: cin connects to fa0's carry-in, fa0's carry-out connects to fa1's carry-in, and so on, with fa3's carry-out as the final cout."
